				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2022a7c elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2022a7c" data-element_type="widget" data-settings='{"_animation":"slideInLeft","_animation_delay":200}' data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Beyond her clinical prowess, Dr. Sameera&rsquo;s career is marked by her visionary leadership and relentless pursuit of excellence. Before steering Sampada VR Specialty Eye Care towards becoming a beacon of hope and innovation in the Malabar region, Dr. Sameera refined her skills and knowledge as a Consultant Phaco and Retina Surgeon at MM Joshi Eye Institute, Hubli, Karnataka, and Maxivision Eye Hospital, Hyderabad. Her tenure as the head of the Vitreo Retinal Department across three branches of Rayhan Eye Hospital, Kerala, underscored her capability to lead, innovate, and inspire.</p><p>As a life member of esteemed organizations such as the Indian Medical Association and the Vitreo Retinal Society of India, and with affiliations to international associations like the Asia Pacific Academy of Ophthalmology, Dr. Sameera&rsquo;s contributions to the field of ophthalmology are globally recognized. Her role as Secretary of the Women Doctors Wing (WDW) of IMA at Tirur exemplifies her commitment to community and professional development.</p>						</div>
				</div>
